{"unit_id":"lubenkov__dsh-pajama-whale#feature-1","repo":"lubenkov/dsh-pajama-whale","commit":"dd246fff468d6ed53464aadefd804ac6ff864d66","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Pajama Whale 的功能「拖动与贴墙」：用户可在窗口中拖动宠物，快速松手可将它抛出，撞到边缘后会挤压并停在那里；再次拖动即可移开。位置和贴墙状态会保存到浏览器本地。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.src.js:140-155","src/client.src.js:874-913","src/client.src.js:426-479"]}
